This folder is intentionally empty in the repository.

Add the real CC0 glTF/GLB asset files here before running the game:

- /public/assets/models/shelf.glb
- /public/assets/models/fridge.glb
- /public/assets/models/checkout.glb
- /public/assets/models/cart.glb
- /public/assets/models/customer.glb

Recommended sources:
- Kenney: https://www.kenney.nl/assets
- Quaternius: https://quaternius.com/
- Poly Pizza: https://poly.pizza/
- Poly Haven: https://polyhaven.com/
- ambientCG: https://ambientcg.com/

Use PBR materials and keep the files in the /public/assets path so the app loads them at runtime.
